{
    "title": "Fiorry: Transgender Dating",
    "description": "Fiorry is the leading dating app for transgender people and their cisgender allies. Using Fiorry, you can finally focus on meeting new people and just having fun without worrying about discrimination or social stigmas.\r\n\r\nTrans opinion leaders and influencers from the transgender and LGBTQ community worldwide speak highly of the new platform, as it solves a lot of the problems that other dating and networking apps caused, with regards to the security and satisfaction of their trans and non-binary users. The Fiorry team is devoted to ensuring a thriving environment that\u2019s safe for everyone.\r\n\r\nWhether you are trans, non-binary, or cis, our LGBTQ inclusive app allows you to be yourself, so you can share your story and feel comfortable getting to know other members on Fiorry. The platform offers a warm, welcoming community where users can find a partner, a friend, or a date. We embrace the full spectrum of gender diversity: from trans, nonbinary, genderfluid, genderqueer, gender-nonconforming and intersex people to their cisgender allies. All gender expressions are invited to join.\r\n\r\nReasons why Fiorry is the #1 dating app for trans folks:\r\n\r\n- Interact with the entire list of active users without infinite swiping.\r\n- Everyone has their preferences, so on Fiorry you have the option to hide your profile from specific age and gender groups.\r\n- You decide which message requests you want to accept.\r\n- Search for users in other regions of the world.\r\n- We moderate all profiles manually and restrict fake or offensive profiles. Fiorry never blocks users because of their gender identity or sexual orientation. \r\n\r\nOur goal is to keep our LGBTQ community safe. Here\u2019s what makes Fiorry the safest dating app out there: \r\n\r\n- We prioritize safety and comfort of LGBTQ members the most and moderate every report made to assure a truly discriminatory-free environment.\r\n- You can help us improve our app's user experience by reporting and blocking disruptive users.\r\n- We\u2019ve given you the option to hide your age or location from other users. \r\n\r\nWe do also respect the safety of users\u2019 personal data:\r\n\r\n- We provide functionality for deleting messages, photos, and chat history on both ends.\r\n- You can send self-deleting images.\r\n- You can delete your profile and all of your data at any time.\r\n\r\nOur mission is to help the transgender community overcome social stigmas and find acceptance. We appreciate that while some people don\u2019t require any sort of transition, there are those with specific gender affirmation goals, which can sometimes be expensive. We want to do our part by sponsoring some of our users with financial aid. Find out more about our Transition Funding Program on our website.\r\n\r\nThe funding program we offer depends on the revenue generated from our paid Plus and Unlimited subscription plans, which users can purchase to get the most out of Fiorry. \r\n\r\nFiorry is all about building a gender-inclusive community based on respect, equality and celebrating diversity. For that reason, we don\u2019t allow the use of offensive language on our platform, and that includes gendered, racial or sexist slurs. We seek to create a dating app for trans people and their allies, which feels inviting to everyone interested in being a part of our community.\r\n\r\nDownload our dating app now to start chatting with trans and non-binary folk nearby, or their cis allies.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------\r\n\r\nIf you choose to purchase Fiorry Plus or Fiorry Unlimited, payment will be charged to your iTunes account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time. The price varies by country and may change without notice, but you can always see the exact price in the app.\r\n\r\nInterested to learn more? Please, check the following links:\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://fiorry.co/privacy-policy\r\nTerms & Conditions: https://fiorry.co/terms-conditions\r\n\r\nJoin us on our social media:\r\nInstagram: @fiorryapp\r\nFacebook: @fiorryapp",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fiorry is the leading dating app for transgender people and their cisgender allies. Using Fiorry, you can finally focus on meeting new people and just having fun without worrying about discrimination or social stigmas.<br><br>Trans opinion leaders and influencers from the transgender and LGBTQ community worldwide speak highly of the new platform, as it solves a lot of the problems that other dating and networking apps caused, with regards to the security and satisfaction of their trans and non-binary users. The Fiorry team is devoted to ensuring a thriving environment that\u2019s safe for everyone.<br><br>Whether you are trans, non-binary, or cis, our LGBTQ inclusive app allows you to be yourself, so you can share your story and feel comfortable getting to know other members on Fiorry. The platform offers a warm, welcoming community where users can find a partner, a friend, or a date. We embrace the full spectrum of gender diversity: from trans, nonbinary, genderfluid, genderqueer, gender-nonconforming and intersex people to their cisgender allies. All gender expressions are invited to join.<br><br>Reasons why Fiorry is the #1 dating app for trans folks:<br><br>- Interact with the entire list of active users without infinite swiping.<br>- Everyone has their preferences, so on Fiorry you have the option to hide your profile from specific age and gender groups.<br>- You decide which message requests you want to accept.<br>- Search for users in other regions of the world.<br>- We moderate all profiles manually and restrict fake or offensive profiles. Fiorry never blocks users because of their gender identity or sexual orientation. <br><br>Our goal is to keep our LGBTQ community safe. Here\u2019s what makes Fiorry the safest dating app out there: <br><br>- We prioritize safety and comfort of LGBTQ members the most and moderate every report made to assure a truly discriminatory-free environment.<br>- You can help us improve our app&#39;s user experience by reporting and blocking disruptive users.<br>- We\u2019ve given you the option to hide your age or location from other users. <br><br>We do also respect the safety of users\u2019 personal data:<br><br>- We provide functionality for deleting messages, photos, and chat history on both ends.<br>- You can send self-deleting images.<br>- You can delete your profile and all of your data at any time.<br><br>Our mission is to help the transgender community overcome social stigmas and find acceptance. We appreciate that while some people don\u2019t require any sort of transition, there are those with specific gender affirmation goals, which can sometimes be expensive. We want to do our part by sponsoring some of our users with financial aid. Find out more about our Transition Funding Program on our website.<br><br>The funding program we offer depends on the revenue generated from our paid Plus and Unlimited subscription plans, which users can purchase to get the most out of Fiorry. <br><br>Fiorry is all about building a gender-inclusive community based on respect, equality and celebrating diversity. For that reason, we don\u2019t allow the use of offensive language on our platform, and that includes gendered, racial or sexist slurs. We seek to create a dating app for trans people and their allies, which feels inviting to everyone interested in being a part of our community.<br><br>Download our dating app now to start chatting with trans and non-binary folk nearby, or their cis allies.<br><br>-----------------------------------<br><br>If you choose to purchase Fiorry Plus or Fiorry Unlimited, payment will be charged to your iTunes account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time. The price varies by country and may change without notice, but you can always see the exact price in the app.<br><br>Interested to learn more? Please, check the following links:<br>Privacy Policy: https://fiorry.co/privacy-policy<br>Terms &amp; Conditions: https://fiorry.co/terms-conditions<br><br>Join us on our social media:<br>Instagram: @fiorryapp<br>Facebook: @fiorryapp",
